    {
      "text": "The allocator moves from `exllamav3.util.tp_split` to `exllamav3.models.model_tp_alloc`. Ten module imports move with it, but the parent search finds an eleventh in `modules/transformer.py`, which the task leaves unchanged. Because `modules/__init__.py` eagerly imports both transformer block classes, the stale import affects the package initializer, not just callers of the planner.",
