      "text": "Plain `MLP.make_tp_allocation` no longer returns an estimate for its up/down projections; it explicitly rejects TP. The two explicit plain-MLP constructions found are Gemma3's vision encoder blocks, which reach it through child traversal if preceding children succeed, and Mistral3's vision projector, which would reach it if queried directly. Both vision models already put an unsupported Conv before those modules; Conv only gains an error message. GatedMLP and sparse expert allocation are not disabled. No forward method is changed by these edits.",
